{"id":101,"chapter_id":0,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"…이것밖에 기억하지 못하다니… 운명은 정말 잔혹하구나…","voice":["vo_cgplot_101001"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"하지만, 괜찮아… 너 자신이 누군지 기억한다면 모든 걸 잃게 되진 않을 거야…","voice":["vo_cgplot_101002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"자, 내 곁으로 돌아와… 너의 전투는 이미 시작됐어.","voice":["vo_cgplot_101003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"…널… 기다릴게…","voice":["vo_cgplot_101004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}